          "investigations": "<p>Τα αποτελέσματα των δοκιμασιών πνευμονικής λειτουργίας φαίνονται παρακάτω:</p><div class=\"lab-table\"><div class=\"lab-row lab-head\"><span>Εξέταση</span><span>Τιμή</span><span>Φυσιολογικό εύρος</span><span>Θέση</span></div><div class=\"lab-row abn\"><span class=\"lab-name\">FEV1 (L)</span><span class=\"lab-val low\">0,55<b>↓</b></span><span class=\"lab-ref\">2,8–3,6</span><span class=\"lab-track\"><span class=\"lab-band\" style=\"left:64.9%;width:21.9%\"></span><span class=\"lab-mark low\" style=\"left:3.3%\"></span></span></div><div class=\"lab-row abn\"><span class=\"lab-name\">FVC (L)</span><span class=\"lab-val low\">1,35<b>↓</b></span><span class=\"lab-ref\">3,8–4,6</span><span class=\"lab-track\"><span class=\"lab-band\" style=\"left:66.8%;width:20.8%\"></span><span class=\"lab-mark low\" style=\"left:3.1%\"></span></span></div><div class=\"lab-row abn\"><span class=\"lab-name\">FER (FEV1/FVC) (%)</span><span class=\"lab-val low\">41<b>↓</b></span><span class=\"lab-ref\">72–80</span><span class=\"lab-track\"><span class=\"lab-band\" style=\"left:71.6%;width:17.8%\"></span><span class=\"lab-mark low\" style=\"left:2.7%\"></span></span></div><div class=\"lab-row abn\"><span class=\"lab-name\">PEF (L/min)</span><span class=\"lab-val low\">90<b>↓</b></span><span class=\"lab-ref\">310–440</span><span class=\"lab-track\"><span class=\"lab-band\" style=\"left:53.5%;width:29.1%\"></span><span class=\"lab-mark low\" style=\"left:4.4%\"></span></span></div></div><p>Η ακτινογραφία θώρακος φαίνεται στην Εικόνα 90.1.</p><figure class=\"case-fig\"><img src=\"assets/images/case_90_1.jpg\" alt=\"Ακτινογραφία θώρακος\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.closest('.case-fig').classList.add('no-img')\"><div class=\"fig-ph\"><b>assets/images/case_90_1.jpg</b>Τοποθετήστε εδώ την εικόνα.</div><figcaption><b>Εικόνα 90.1</b> · Ακτινογραφία θώρακος</figcaption></figure>",
